ng, as composed in <Picture 4>. Its curved windows, city skyline, rails, pale floor, cool daylight and clear open air remain visually identical.\\n<Subject 3> is the complete flat financial knowledge diagram in input image3, 图3-纯知识卡-v3.png, placed exactly as shown in <Picture 4>. It consists solely of one outlined circle, fixed cyan lines, three rectangular translucent cards and their large white Chinese text. All shapes are anchored permanently in the same positions.\\n<Picture 4> is input image4, 图4-已核对干净构图.png: the previously verified clean complete lesson composition, with the same man at left and the fully readable fixed flat diagram at right. It is a full composition and appearance reference, not a first-frame or last-frame instruction. Preserve all depicted graphical surfaces and all depicted clear empty spaces.\\n<Audio 1> is the complete newly cloned narration in H3音频1-口播及收束静音.wav, assigned only to <Subject 1> (S1). Retain its exact timing, original voice, pauses, fluent shu1 kun4 units and trailing silence. Narration affects sound and mouth movement only.\\n\\nsummary:\\n[reference generation + copied narration] A calm fixed 8.292-second 1376x768 financial lesson. Reproduce the complete clean composition of <Picture 4> as a continuous live presenter shot. The teacher reads the existing financial knowledge cards. The only graphical response is a soft change in an existing card border's brightness.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - same identity, hairstyle, glasses, plain suit lapels, white shirt and burgundy tie.\\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - same static bright studio, skyline, rails, floor, lighting and clear air.\\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - same fixed circle, lines, card rectangles and exact large words, always identical in shape, scale and position.\\n<Picture 4>: composition_preserved - carry its completed clean lesson layout, garment appearance, large glyp